# The story cast (WP-S4: design/data/npcs.toml, economy/guild_npcs.js, story/cast.js; talk words in story.toml).
# `ttl cast ...`, `ttl guild npc expect ...` and `ttl story expect ...` print "ttl: ..." when something does not hold, which
# `server.sh test-all` counts as a failure. A spot whose build is not placed on the server is SKIPPED (the line `cast verify all:
# N ok, M skipped` tells how many were), so the test is green on a world with only Tempest and meaningful on a full one.
# Needs Easy NPC with the presets from config/easy_npc/preset and `ttl` in security.cfg executeAsUserCommandAllowList.ALL.
# Bot A is a Life 2 soul on the light path, bot B on the dark path.
# Expect in the log: "[ttl] guild npc: benimaru_tempest (benimaru) spawned at ...", and no "[ttl] guild npc: importing ...
# failed", "[ttl] cast: summoning ... failed", "cast command failed" or "right-click handling failed".
# Also check in game (not asserted): right-click Benimaru -> dialog with a Talk button -> the chat line; right-click a statue
# (Hinata in Lubelius) -> the same chat line, no Tensura menu; shift + right-click -> Tensura's own interaction; Rigurd and
# Gobta (goblins in Tempest's north-east quarter) talk instead of opening the trade screen; the statues face the way their
# spot says and stand still; a drawn skin in assets/ttl/textures/entity/npc/<kind>.png shows on the NPC after gen_npcs.py.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotCastA
ttlbot spawn TtlBotCastB
@sleep 2
ttl reset TtlBotCastA
ttl reset TtlBotCastB
kubejs stages add TtlBotCastA ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotCastB ttl.life2
ttl story set TtlBotCastA light
ttl story set TtlBotCastB dark
# ---- data: every kind and hook talks with a story.toml character ----
# The preset files are checked offline (validate.py runs gen_npcs.py --check); in game KubeJS' class filter denies
# java.io.File, so `ttl guild npc expect presets` can only answer n/a. The count_* lines below prove the imports worked.
ttl cast expect talk_ids_known true
# ---- what the cast says depends on the soul (picks, not chat: `ttl story expect <player> talk <npc> <entry>`) ----
# Benimaru: entry 1 = act 1 for everyone, light act 2 = entry 2 once the Oath is done; the soul is still at act 1 here.
ttl story expect TtlBotCastA talk benimaru 1
ttl story expect TtlBotCastA talk hinata 1
ttl story expect TtlBotCastB talk outcast_contact 2
execute as TtlBotCastA run ttl story talk benimaru
execute as TtlBotCastA run ttl story talk hinata
execute as TtlBotCastA run ttl story talk gazel
# ---- placement: force-load every placed spot, let the check run, then verify ----
ttl cast load
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload add ${anchor:tempest.x+16} ${anchor:tempest.z-48} ${anchor:tempest.x+31} ${anchor:tempest.z-28}
@sleep 8
ttl guild npc ensure
@sleep 2
ttl guild npc ensure
ttl cast verify all
# Exactly one of the Tempest cast (the Tempest spots exist wherever Tempest is placed, which this test needs).
ttl guild npc expect count_benimaru_tempest 1
ttl guild npc expect count_shion_tempest 1
ttl guild npc expect count_souei_tempest 1
ttl guild npc expect tags_benimaru_tempest ok
ttl guild npc expect type_benimaru_tempest "easy_npc:humanoid"
ttl guild npc expect type_shuna_tempest "easy_npc:humanoid_slim"
ttl guild npc expect invulnerable_benimaru_tempest true
ttl guild npc expect talk_benimaru_tempest benimaru
ttl guild npc expect name_benimaru_tempest Benimaru
# The Outcast of the south road stands on the surface at world 0, 52 (surface spot).
ttl guild npc expect count_outcast_road 1
ttl guild npc expect talk_outcast_road outcast_contact
# Idempotent, and an extra copy is removed again by the next check (guild_npcs.rcon proves the same for the guild).
ttl guild npc ensure benimaru_tempest
ttl guild npc expect count_benimaru_tempest 1
ttl guild npc spawn benimaru_tempest
ttl guild npc expect count_benimaru_tempest 2
ttl guild npc ensure benimaru_tempest
ttl guild npc expect count_benimaru_tempest 1
# Kind counts (every Easy NPC kind of the cast and the statues).
ttl guild npc expect count_benimaru 1
ttl guild npc expect count_kabal 1
# ---- the right-click: hooks on existing entities and the statues (skipped when nothing is loaded there) ----
# The goblins of Tempest talk as Rigurd and Gobta; Gazel's throne statue (Dwargon) as Gazel.
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastA rigurd rigurd
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastA gobta gobta
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastA gazel_throne gazel
# Statues of the mod characters (type, NoAI, invulnerable and the talk tag are part of `cast verify all` above): a right-click
# answers with the story character.
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastA hinata_lubelius hinata
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastA luminous_lubelius luminous
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastA carrion_laura carrion
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastA folgen_marris folgen
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastA kyoya_marris kyoya
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastB hinata_lubelius hinata
# Easy NPCs of the far towns answer through their Talk button; the id they are wired to is checked.
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastA treyni_shrine treyni
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastA milim_forgotten_dragon_city milim
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastA edmaris_marris edmaris
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastA yuuki_englassia yuuki
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastA frey_walpurgis frey
ttl cast interact TtlBotCastA ramiris_spirit_dwelling ramiris
# ---- a stand-in: the guild trio waits in Tempest's longhouse until Blumund is placed, then Blumund's spots take over ----
# (`cast verify all` above already counted exactly one of each: a stand-in and its Blumund spot share the tag.)
ttl guild npc expect count_gido 1
# ---- clean up ----
ttl cast unload
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload remove ${anchor:tempest.x+16} ${anchor:tempest.z-48} ${anchor:tempest.x+31} ${anchor:tempest.z-28}
ttl reset TtlBotCastA
ttl reset TtlBotCastB
ttlbot remove TtlBotCastA
ttlbot remove TtlBotCastB
